## Shared Harness Conventions

This project inherits cross-project conventions automatically via
`~/.claude/` (deployed from the Harness repo):
- Engineering principles: `~/.claude/rules/engineering-principles.md`,
  `~/.claude/rules/surgical-changes.md`, `~/.claude/rules/architecture-culture.md`
- Specialist subagents: `~/.claude/agents/` (risk-analyst, pr-drafter,
  data-analyst, log-analyst, docs-writer, task-triage, debugger)
- Secrets-by-label convention: see the Harness repo's `Secrets/manifest.yaml`
  and `Scripts/harness/secure/`

Project-specific rules in this file always take precedence over general
Harness conventions when they conflict.
